  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>A. A. Gaskins is listed at No. 77 <ref target="civic?id=Barry%20Street">Barry Street</ref> in 1910 and 1915, with a general store in 1915.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>On the electoral roll</head>
        <p>Arthur Allen Gaskins, storekeeper, is on the 1919 <ref target="civic?id=Electoral-Rolls">electoral roll</ref> at 77 Barry Street.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Neighbours</head>
        <p>Joseph W. Miller is at No. 75 and Mrs Ada Baker at No. 79. No. 77 is still a shop later: <ref target="civic?id=William%20Edward%20Kemp">William Edward Kemp</ref>, grocer, is there in 1930.</p>
      </div>
